    ('RAM-STIRFRY-SPICY-1', 'stir-fry-spicy', 'Shin Ramyun Stir Fry — Single Pack', 'Shin Ramyun Stir Fry', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Nongshim', '신라면 볶음면', 'Instant Noodles', '131g', 4, '3-4 mins', 'Popular', 'The no-soup version for people who want the chilli undiluted. Thick sauce clings to every strand.', 'The no-soup version for people who want the chilli undiluted. Thick sauce clings to every strand.', 'The Shin flavour without the soup. Extra elastic noodles cook in under four minutes, get drained, then take on a concentrated spicy beef sauce and chilli oil that clings to every strand. Shiitake, bok choy and the little fish cakes stamped with the Shin character come along in the vegetable mix. Undiluted heat, because there is no broth to soften it.', 'Boil for 3 to 4 minutes, drain almost completely, then toss with the sauce and oil sachets over low heat.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, chilli seasoning oil, sugar, soy sauce powder, garlic, shiitake mushroom powder, dried fish cake, dried bok choy, black pepper, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy, fish and beef. May contain milk, egg and shellfish.', '{"basis": "Per 131g pack", "energy": "600 kcal", "fat": "22g", "satFat": "8g", "carbs": "88g", "fibre": "3g", "sugars": "8g", "protein": "11g", "sodium": "1290mg"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/nongshim-shin-ramyun-stir-fry-v2.jpeg', 'assets/products/stir-fry-spicy.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/stir-fry-spicy.html', 13, true),
