    ('RAM-STIRFRY-CHEESE-1', 'stir-fry-cheese', 'Shin Ramyun Stir Fry Cheese — Single Pack', 'Shin Ramyun Stir Fry Cheese', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Nongshim', '신라면 볶음면 치즈', 'Instant Noodles', '136g', 3, '3-4 mins', 'Cheesy & Spicy', 'Drained stir-fry noodles tossed in a sweet chilli sauce and finished with a generous cheese powder sachet.', 'Drained stir-fry noodles tossed in a sweet chilli sauce and finished with a generous cheese powder sachet.', 'The same drained stir fry format as the spicy version, with a generous cheddar powder sachet added at the end. The cheese rounds off the chilli without cancelling it, so the heat arrives later and softer. A good bridge for anyone stepping up from Chapagetti towards the properly hot packs.', 'Drain hard, stir the sauce through first, then sprinkle the cheese powder over the top so it melts in streaks rather than dissolving.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, cheese seasoning powder (cheddar cheese, whey powder, milk), spicy stir-fry sauce mix, chilli seasoning oil, garlic, dried carrot, dried fish cake, sugar, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy, milk and fish. May contain egg and shellfish.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/nongshim-shin-ramyun-stir-fry-cheese-v2.jpeg', 'assets/products/stir-fry-cheese.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/stir-fry-cheese.html', 16, true),
