    ('RAM-CHAMPONG-1', 'cham-pong', 'Champong Seafood Ramyun — Single Pack', 'Champong Seafood Ramyun', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Nongshim', '짬뽕', 'Instant Noodles', '130g', 4, '4-5 mins', 'Seafood Favourite', 'Seafood noodle soup in the Korean-Chinese style, with squid and vegetable flakes in a peppery red broth.', 'Seafood noodle soup in the Korean-Chinese style, with squid and vegetable flakes in a peppery red broth.', 'Champong is the Korean-Chinese seafood noodle soup you get from takeaway shops, and this is Nongshim''s version of it. The broth is smoky and peppery rather than sweet, built from cuttlefish, mussel, scallop, shrimp and crab with a red chilli oil finish. Cabbage, bok choy and seaweed flakes rehydrate into something closer to a restaurant bowl than most instant seafood packs manage.', 'Cook in 550ml of water for 4 to 5 minutes. A handful of prawns or mussels dropped in at the start turns it into a proper meal.', 'Enriched wheat flour, potato starch, palm oil, modified potato starch, dried vegetable flakes (cabbage, bok choy, red chilli, mushroom, seaweed), seasoned oil (corn oil, canola oil, chilli pepper, garlic), cuttlefish extract, mussel extract, shrimp extract, crab extract, beef bone extract, salt, maltodextrin.', 'Contains wheat, soy, sesame, crab and shrimp. May contain milk, egg, fish, tree nuts and peanuts.', '{"basis": "Per 130g pack", "energy": "560 kcal", "fat": "19g", "satFat": "9g", "carbs": "89g", "fibre": "3g", "sugars": "4g", "protein": "9g", "sodium": "1810mg"}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/cham-pong.html', 25, true),
