    ('RAM-CHAPAGETTI-1', 'chapagetti', 'Chapagetti — Single Pack', 'Chapagetti', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Nongshim', '짜파게티', 'Instant Noodles', '140g', 0, '5 mins', 'Kid Friendly', 'Korea''s take on jjajangmyeon, built on a roasted black bean sauce. Savoury, mildly sweet, no chilli at all.', 'Korea''s take on jjajangmyeon, built on a roasted black bean sauce. Savoury, mildly sweet, no chilli at all.', 'Korea''s answer to jjajangmyeon, and the number one non-soup instant noodle in the country. A roasted black bean sauce coats thick noodles with dried onion, cabbage and soy protein pieces, finished with a sachet of olive oil that lifts the whole thing. Completely free of chilli, which makes it the safe order for children and anyone who has been defeated by fire noodles.', 'Boil for 5 minutes, drain to about eight spoons of water, then stir the powder and olive oil sachets through off the heat. Add Neoguri for the Chapaguri everyone asks about.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, roasted black bean paste powder (chunjang), extra virgin olive oil, dried onion, dried cabbage, textured soy protein, caramel colour, glucose, sugar, salt.', 'Contains wheat and soy. May contain milk, egg, fish and beef.', '{"basis": "Per 140g pack", "energy": "600 kcal", "fat": "20g", "satFat": "9g", "carbs": "94g", "fibre": "3g", "sugars": "6g", "protein": "11g", "sodium": "1180mg"}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/chapagetti.html', 28, true),
