    ('RAM-ANSUNG-1', 'ansung', 'Ansungtangmyun — Single Pack', 'Ansungtangmyun', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Nongshim', '안성탕면', 'Instant Noodles', '125g', 2, '4-5 mins', 'Heritage Classic', 'A soybean paste broth that is thicker and earthier than the usual chilli-forward ramyun. Mild and hearty.', 'A soybean paste broth that is thicker and earthier than the usual chilli-forward ramyun. Mild and hearty.', 'Named after the town of Anseong and on shelves since 1983, Ansungtangmyun is the doenjang pack. Fermented soybean paste and beef stock give it an earthy, almost miso-like depth that is thicker and rounder than the chilli-forward ramyun most people start with. There is warmth rather than heat, which makes it the one to reach for when you want comfort instead of a challenge.', 'Cook in 550ml of water for 4 to 5 minutes. Tofu cubes and courgette suit this broth better than egg.', 'Wheat flour, potato starch, palm oil, rice flour, wheat gluten, soybean paste powder (doenjang), beef extract powder, dried seaweed, dried cabbage, garlic, onion, red pepper, black pepper, mushroom, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy and beef. May contain milk, egg and fish.', '{"basis": "Per 125g pack", "energy": "540 kcal", "fat": "20g", "satFat": "9g", "carbs": "81g", "fibre": "3g", "sugars": "4g", "protein": "10g", "sodium": "1720mg"}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/ansung.html', 31, true),
