    ('RAM-HOTDAK-ORIGINAL-1', 'hotdak-original', 'Hot Dak Stir-Fry Ramen Original — Single Pack', 'Hot Dak Stir-Fry Ramen Original', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Migawon', '핫닭 볶음면', 'Instant Noodles', '140g', 5, '4-5 mins', 'Fire Challenge', 'The original fire chicken challenge, sweet up front and genuinely punishing after. Keep something cold within arm''s reach.', 'The original fire chicken challenge, sweet up front and genuinely punishing after. Keep something cold within arm''s reach.', 'Migawon''s fire chicken stir fry noodle, and the pack that gets bought for the challenge as much as the flavour. Sweet and garlicky for the first mouthful, then the capsaicin builds and keeps building for a good while after the bowl is empty. Toasted sesame and seaweed flakes come in a separate sachet to scatter at the end.', 'Boil for 5 minutes, drain to roughly eight spoons of water, stir the sauce through and top with the sesame and seaweed sachet. Milk on standby.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, hot chicken sauce (red chilli powder, capsaicin extract, soy sauce, sugar, garlic, onion), chicken extract, roasted sesame seeds, dried seaweed flakes, black pepper, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy, sesame and chicken. May contain milk, egg and fish.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/hot-dak-stir-fry-ramen-original-v2.jpeg', 'assets/products/hotdak-original.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/hotdak-original.html', 34, true),
