    ('RAM-HOTDAK-CARBO-1', 'hotdak-carbo', 'Hot Dak Carbo Stir-Fry Ramen — Single Pack', 'Hot Dak Carbo Stir-Fry Ramen', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Migawon', '까르보 핫닭 볶음면', 'Instant Noodles', '140g', 3, '4-5 mins', 'Creamy Heat', 'Fire chicken heat wrapped in a creamy carbonara sauce that rounds off the sharp edges.', 'Fire chicken heat wrapped in a creamy carbonara sauce that rounds off the sharp edges.', 'Fire chicken heat wrapped in a creamy carbonara sauce that takes the sharp edges off without removing the burn. Still clearly spicy, just rounder and easier to finish than the original. The pack most people reach for first if they have heard about fire noodles but are not ready to commit.', 'Drain almost dry, stir the carbonara sauce through, then add a splash of milk if you want it milder still.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, cream powder, cheese powder, milk powder, hot chicken sauce (red chilli powder, capsaicin extract, soy sauce, sugar, garlic), roasted sesame seeds, dried parsley, black pepper, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy, milk, sesame and chicken. May contain egg and fish.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/migawon-carbo-hotdak-stir-fry-ramen-v2.jpeg', 'assets/products/hotdak-carbo.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/hotdak-carbo.html', 37, true),
