    ('RAM-HOTDAK-CHEESE-1', 'hotdak-cheese', 'Hot Dak Cheese Stir-Fry Ramen — Single Pack', 'Hot Dak Cheese Stir-Fry Ramen', 'Single Pack', 1, 750, 750, 'Migawon', '치즈 핫닭 볶음면', 'Instant Noodles', '150g', 4, '4-5 mins', 'Cheesy Fire', 'Fire chicken noodles with a cheese layer stirred through at the end. A good entry point to the fire packs.', 'Fire chicken noodles with a cheese layer stirred through at the end. A good entry point to the fire packs.', 'Fire chicken noodles with a cheese layer stirred through at the end. Less taming than the carbo version and more of a savoury counterweight to the chilli, so the heat still arrives but with something to push against. A sensible entry point if the original pack has already beaten you once.', 'Stir the sauce through first, then the cheese powder, so it melts into the noodles instead of clumping.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, cheddar cheese powder, whey powder, hot chicken sauce (red chilli powder, capsaicin extract, soy sauce, sugar, garlic, onion), roasted sesame seeds, dried seaweed flakes, black pepper, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy, milk, sesame and chicken. May contain egg and fish.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/hotdak-cheese.html', 40, true),
