    ('CUP-SHIN-1', 'shin-ramyun-cup', 'Shin Ramyun Cup — Single Cup', 'Shin Ramyun Cup', 'Single Cup', 1, 560, 560, 'Nongshim', '신라면 컵', 'Cup Noodles', '68g', 4, '3 mins', 'Ready in 3 mins', 'Shin''s signature spicy beef broth portioned into a single-serve cup. Just add boiling water.', 'Shin''s signature spicy beef broth portioned into a single-serve cup. Just add boiling water.', 'The same spicy beef and mushroom broth as the original Shin pack, portioned into a single serve cup that needs nothing but a kettle. Thinner noodles than the bag version so they soften in three minutes flat, which makes this the default choice for hostel rooms, office desks and late shifts.', 'Fill to the inside line with boiling water, close the lid and wait 3 minutes. No pot, no draining.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, salt, hydrolysed soy protein, red chilli pepper, garlic, shiitake mushroom extract, beef bone extract, dried spring onion, dried carrot, black pepper.', 'Contains wheat, soy and beef. May contain milk, egg and fish.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/shin-cup.webp', 'assets/products/shin-ramyun-cup.webp', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/shin-ramyun-cup.html', 43, true),
