    ('CUP-TOOMBA-20', 'toomba-cup', 'Shin Ramyun Toomba Cup — Carton (20)', 'Shin Ramyun Toomba Cup', 'Carton (20)', 20, 15900, 795, 'Nongshim', '신라면 툼바 컵', 'Cup Noodles', '80g', 3, '3 mins', 'Ready in 3 mins', 'The creamy carbonara ramyun in a desk-friendly cup that needs nothing but hot water.', 'The creamy carbonara ramyun in a desk-friendly cup that needs nothing but hot water.', 'The creamy Toomba sauce in a desk friendly cup that needs nothing but hot water and three minutes. Drain through the lid, stir the sachet through and you have the same rich cheese and chilli coating as the bag version at roughly half the portion.', 'Fill to the line, wait 3 minutes, drain through the lid spout, then stir the sauce sachet through.', 'Wheat flour, palm oil, potato starch, cream powder, cheddar cheese powder, milk powder, garlic, red chilli powder, black pepper, dried parsley, sugar, salt.', 'Contains wheat, soy and milk. May contain egg, fish and beef.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/toomba-cup.html', 48, true),
    ('BEV-BANANA-MILK-1', 'banana-milk', 'Binggrae Banana Flavoured Milk — Single Carton', 'Binggrae Banana Flavoured Milk', 'Single Carton', 1, 590, 590, 'Binggrae', '바나나맛우유', 'Beverages', '200ml', null, null, 'Korean Icon', 'The Korean convenience-store classic, mellow and creamy with a gentle banana sweetness.', 'The Korean convenience-store classic, mellow and creamy with a gentle banana sweetness.', 'The Korean convenience store classic, in the 200ml carton that comes with a straw taped to the front and carries the same fat pot-shaped bottle on its label — a design that has barely changed since 1974. Mellow and creamy with a gentle banana sweetness rather than a candy one, and enough real milk in it to actually be filling. The single most recognisable drink in Korea.', 'Best served cold, straight from the fridge.', 'Milk 60%, water, sugar, skim milk powder 1.9%, whey powder (milk), banana juice concentrate 0.32%, artificial flavours, emulsifier (mono- and di-glycerides of fatty acids), stabilizers (carrageenan, guar gum), colours (tartrazine, sunset yellow FCF).', 'Contains milk.', '{"basis": "Per 200ml carton", "energy": "160 kcal", "fat": "5.5g", "satFat": "3.3g", "carbs": "22g", "fibre": "0g", "sugars": "21g", "protein": "5g", "sodium": "85mg"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/binggrae-banana-flavoured-milk.jpeg', 'assets/products/banana-milk.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/banana-milk.html', 49, true),
