    ('BEV-MELON-MILK-1', 'melon-milk', 'Binggrae Melon Flavoured Milk — Single Carton', 'Binggrae Melon Flavoured Milk', 'Single Carton', 1, 590, 590, 'Binggrae', '메로나 메론맛우유', 'Beverages', '200ml', null, null, null, 'Korean muskmelon blended into milk for a fragrant, dessert-like drink.', 'Korean muskmelon blended into milk for a fragrant, dessert-like drink.', 'Korean muskmelon blended into milk for a fragrant, dessert-like drink that lands somewhere between honeydew and the Melona ice bar it shares a name with. Sweeter and more perfumed than the banana version, and the one people tend to buy after they have already worked through that one.', 'Serve very cold. Tastes closest to the Melona ice bar that way.', 'Milk 60%, water, sugar, skim milk powder 1.9%, whey powder (milk), melon juice concentrate 0.1%, artificial flavours, emulsifier (mono- and di-glycerides of fatty acids), stabilizers (carrageenan, guar gum), colours (tartrazine, brilliant blue FCF).', 'Contains milk.', '{"basis": "Per 200ml carton", "energy": "160 kcal", "fat": "6g", "satFat": "3.5g", "carbs": "22g", "fibre": "0g", "sugars": "21g", "protein": "5g", "sodium": "85mg"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/binggrae-melon-flavoured-milk.jpeg', 'assets/products/melon-milk.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/melon-milk.html', 52, true),
