    ('BEV-STRAWBERRY-MILK-1', 'strawberry-milk', 'Binggrae Strawberry Flavoured Milk — Single Carton', 'Binggrae Strawberry Flavoured Milk', 'Single Carton', 1, 590, 590, 'Binggrae', '딸기맛우유', 'Beverages', '200ml', null, null, null, 'Smooth milk drink with a soft, jammy strawberry flavour. A reliable pick for children.', 'Smooth milk drink with a soft, jammy strawberry flavour. A reliable pick for children.', 'Smooth milk with a soft, jammy strawberry flavour that stays on the gentle side rather than turning sharp. The most reliable pick of the three for children, and the one adults who avoid the banana carton usually settle on. Same 200ml carton with a straw taped to the front.', 'Serve chilled.', 'Milk 60%, water, sugar, skim milk powder 1.9%, whey powder (milk), strawberry juice concentrate 0.11%, artificial flavours, emulsifier (mono- and di-glycerides of fatty acids), stabilizers (carrageenan, guar gum), colour (allura red AC).', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/binggrae-strawberry-flavoured-milk.jpeg', 'assets/products/strawberry-milk.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/strawberry-milk.html', 55, true),
