    ('BEV-OKF-ALOE-1', 'okf-aloe-drink', 'OKF Aloe Vera King — Single Bottle', 'OKF Aloe Vera King', 'Single Bottle', 1, 690, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '500ml', null, null, 'Shelf Favourite', 'Lightly sweetened aloe vera juice with soft chunks of pulp suspended throughout.', 'Lightly sweetened aloe vera juice with soft chunks of pulp suspended throughout.', 'Lightly sweetened aloe vera juice with soft chunks of real aloe gel suspended through it. Mild and cooling rather than sugary, and the pulp gives it something to chew on, which is half the appeal. The bottle most people in Sri Lanka already recognise from supermarket shelves.', 'Shake gently before opening so the pulp spreads through the bottle.', 'Water, aloe vera juice (22%), fructose, aloe vera gel (8%), calcium lactate, gellan gum, citric acid, sodium citrate, natural grape flavour, sugar.', 'No declared allergens.', '{"basis": "Per 500ml bottle", "energy": "200 kcal", "fat": "0g", "carbs": "50g", "sugars": "48g", "protein": "0g", "sodium": "25mg"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-aloe-vera-king.jpeg', 'assets/products/okf-aloe-drink.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/okf-aloe-drink.html', 58, true),
