    ('BEV-OLATTE-PEACH-1', 'olatte-peach', 'OKF Olatte Peach — Single Can', 'OKF Olatte Peach', 'Single Can', 1, 690, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'A peach latte that layers stone fruit over a milky base without turning heavy.', 'A peach latte that layers stone fruit over a milky base without turning heavy.', 'A peach latte that layers stone fruit over a milky base without turning heavy. Sweet but not cloying, and unusual enough to be worth trying if you have only ever had peach as an iced tea. Sold in the slim 240ml can.', 'Good chilled, and equally good warmed in cold weather.', 'Water, sugar, skimmed milk powder, peach juice concentrate, vegetable cream, natural flavours, emulsifier, stabiliser.', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-olatte-peach.jpeg', 'assets/products/olatte-peach.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/olatte-peach.html', 61, true),
