    ('BEV-OLATTE-STRAWBERRY-20', 'olatte-strawberry', 'OKF Olatte Strawberry — Carton (20)', 'OKF Olatte Strawberry', 'Carton (20)', 20, 13800, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, 'New', 'A strawberry latte with the fruit up front and a soft milky finish behind it.', 'A strawberry latte with the fruit up front and a soft milky finish behind it.', 'The strawberry version of the Olatte can, and the easiest one to hand to someone who has never tried a Korean milk drink. Strawberry sits up front, sweet and jammy rather than sharp, with the milky base filling in underneath so it drinks smooth instead of thin. Sold in the same slim 240ml can as the peach.', 'Best cold, straight from the chiller. Shake the can before opening.', 'Water, sugar, skimmed milk powder, strawberry juice concentrate, vegetable cream, natural flavours, emulsifier, stabiliser, colour.', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-olatte-strawberry.jpeg', 'assets/products/olatte-strawberry.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/olatte-strawberry.html', 66, true),
    ('BEV-OLATTE-APPLE-1', 'olatte-apple', 'OKF Olatte Apple — Single Can', 'OKF Olatte Apple', 'Single Can', 1, 690, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, 'New', 'Orchard apple over a milky base, tart enough at the edges to keep it from turning flat.', 'Orchard apple over a milky base, tart enough at the edges to keep it from turning flat.', 'The apple Olatte keeps a bit of orchard tartness at the edges, which is what stops it going flat the way sweet apple drinks usually do. The milky base rounds it off without burying the fruit, and it lands somewhere between an apple juice and a soft dessert drink. Same slim 240ml can as the rest of the Olatte range.', 'Best cold, straight from the chiller. Shake the can before opening.', 'Water, sugar, skimmed milk powder, apple juice concentrate, vegetable cream, natural flavours, emulsifier, stabiliser.', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-olatte-apple.jpeg', 'assets/products/olatte-apple.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/olatte-apple.html', 67, true),
