    ('BEV-OLATTE-PEAR-1', 'olatte-pear-cream-soda', 'OKF Olatte Pear Cream Soda — Single Can', 'OKF Olatte Pear Cream Soda', 'Single Can', 1, 690, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, 'New', 'Korean pear over a creamy soda base, fizzy and mellow at the same time.', 'Korean pear over a creamy soda base, fizzy and mellow at the same time.', 'A cream soda built on Korean pear rather than vanilla, which keeps it lighter than most drinks carrying the cream soda name. The pear brings that clean, slightly floral sweetness Koreans use in everything from marinades to hangover cures, and the carbonation stops the creaminess from sitting heavy. Comes in the 240ml can.', 'Serve very cold. Good alongside the stir-fry packs, where the sweetness cuts the chilli.', 'Carbonated water, sugar, pear juice concentrate, skimmed milk powder, natural flavours, citric acid, stabiliser.', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-olatte-pear-cream-soda.jpeg', 'assets/products/olatte-pear-cream-soda.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/olatte-pear-cream-soda.html', 70, true),
