    ('BEV-OLATTE-PEAR-20', 'olatte-pear-cream-soda', 'OKF Olatte Pear Cream Soda — Carton (20)', 'OKF Olatte Pear Cream Soda', 'Carton (20)', 20, 13800, 690, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, 'New', 'Korean pear over a creamy soda base, fizzy and mellow at the same time.', 'Korean pear over a creamy soda base, fizzy and mellow at the same time.', 'A cream soda built on Korean pear rather than vanilla, which keeps it lighter than most drinks carrying the cream soda name. The pear brings that clean, slightly floral sweetness Koreans use in everything from marinades to hangover cures, and the carbonation stops the creaminess from sitting heavy. Comes in the 240ml can.', 'Serve very cold. Good alongside the stir-fry packs, where the sweetness cuts the chilli.', 'Carbonated water, sugar, pear juice concentrate, skimmed milk powder, natural flavours, citric acid, stabiliser.', 'Contains milk.', '{}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-olatte-pear-cream-soda.jpeg', 'assets/products/olatte-pear-cream-soda.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/olatte-pear-cream-soda.html', 72, true),
    ('BEV-ONCUP-BLUELEMON-1', 'oncup-blue-lemon', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon — Single Cup', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon', 'Single Cup', 1, 760, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish. As much about the colour as the flavour, which is exactly why it sells, and the sharpness holds up better than most blue drinks once the ice starts melting.', 'Best served very cold, straight from the chiller.', 'Carbonated water, sugar, lemon juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour (brilliant blue).', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-blue-lemon.html', 73, true),
    ('BEV-ONCUP-BLUELEMON-5', 'oncup-blue-lemon', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon — 5 Pack', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon', '5 Pack', 5, 3800, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish. As much about the colour as the flavour, which is exactly why it sells, and the sharpness holds up better than most blue drinks once the ice starts melting.', 'Best served very cold, straight from the chiller.', 'Carbonated water, sugar, lemon juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour (brilliant blue).', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-blue-lemon.html', 74, true),
    ('BEV-ONCUP-BLUELEMON-20', 'oncup-blue-lemon', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon — Carton (20)', 'OKF Oncup Blue Lemon', 'Carton (20)', 20, 15200, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish.', 'A bright blue lemon soda with a sharp citrus bite and a sweet finish. As much about the colour as the flavour, which is exactly why it sells, and the sharpness holds up better than most blue drinks once the ice starts melting.', 'Best served very cold, straight from the chiller.', 'Carbonated water, sugar, lemon juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour (brilliant blue).', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-blue-lemon.html', 75, true),
    ('BEV-ONCUP-BLUEBERRY-1', 'oncup-blue-berry', 'OKF Oncup Blueberry — Single Cup', 'OKF Oncup Blueberry', 'Single Cup', 1, 760, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'Deep purple blueberry drink with a tart edge that stops it from being cloying.', 'Deep purple blueberry drink with a tart edge that stops it from being cloying.', 'Deep purple blueberry drink with a tart edge that stops it turning cloying. The acidity makes it one of the better things to have alongside a fire noodle pack, where a sweeter drink would just add to the load.', 'Serve chilled. Pairs well with the spicier stir-fry packs.', 'Water, sugar, blueberry juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour.', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-blue-berry.html', 76, true),
