    ('BEV-ONCUP-GREENGRAPE-1', 'oncup-green-grape', 'OKF Oncup Green Grape — Single Cup', 'OKF Oncup Green Grape', 'Single Cup', 1, 760, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'Made with green grape rather than the usual dark varieties, so it drinks light and floral.', 'Made with green grape rather than the usual dark varieties, so it drinks light and floral.', 'Made with green grape rather than the usual dark varieties, so it drinks light and floral instead of heavy and jammy. One of the more grown up flavours in the range and a steady repeat buy.', 'Serve chilled.', 'Water, sugar, green grape juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C.', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-green-grape.html', 79, true),
