    ('BEV-ONCUP-PEACHTEA-1', 'oncup-peach-iced-tea', 'OKF Oncup Peach Iced Tea — Single Cup', 'OKF Oncup Peach Iced Tea', 'Single Cup', 1, 760, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '240ml', null, null, null, 'Brewed black tea rounded out with ripe peach, light on sugar for an iced tea.', 'Brewed black tea rounded out with ripe peach, light on sugar for an iced tea.', 'Brewed black tea rounded out with ripe peach and kept light on sugar for an iced tea. Refreshing without the syrupy finish most bottled versions have, which makes it the easiest of the Oncup range to drink a whole one of.', 'Serve over ice.', 'Water, sugar, black tea extract, peach juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C.', 'No declared allergens.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-peach-iced-tea.html', 82, true),
