    ('BEV-ONCUP-WATERMELON-1', 'oncup-watermelon', 'OKF Oncup Watermelon — Single Pouch', 'OKF Oncup Watermelon', 'Single Pouch', 1, 760, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '230ml', null, null, null, 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy. A hot-afternoon favourite.', 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy. A hot-afternoon favourite.', 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy, which is rarer than it sounds in this category. A hot afternoon favourite and the fastest mover of the Oncup flavours among younger customers.', 'Serve very cold.', 'Water, sugar, watermelon juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour.', 'No declared allergens.', '{"basis": "Per 230ml pouch", "energy": "50 kcal"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-oncup-watermelon.jpeg', 'assets/products/oncup-watermelon.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-watermelon.html', 85, true),
