    ('BEV-ONCUP-WATERMELON-20', 'oncup-watermelon', 'OKF Oncup Watermelon — Carton (20)', 'OKF Oncup Watermelon', 'Carton (20)', 20, 15200, 760, 'OKF', null, 'Beverages', '230ml', null, null, null, 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy. A hot-afternoon favourite.', 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy. A hot-afternoon favourite.', 'Watermelon juice drink that tastes closer to the fruit than to candy, which is rarer than it sounds in this category. A hot afternoon favourite and the fastest mover of the Oncup flavours among younger customers.', 'Serve very cold.', 'Water, sugar, watermelon juice concentrate, citric acid, natural flavours, vitamin C, colour.', 'No declared allergens.', '{"basis": "Per 230ml pouch", "energy": "50 kcal"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/okf-oncup-watermelon.jpeg', 'assets/products/oncup-watermelon.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/oncup-watermelon.html', 87, true),
    ('BEV-BACCHUS-1', 'bacchus', 'Bacchus Energy Drink — Single Can', 'Bacchus Energy Drink', 'Single Can', 1, 690, 690, 'Dong-A', '박카스', 'Beverages', '250ml', null, null, 'New', 'Korea''s original energy tonic since 1963, built on taurine, ginseng and royal jelly rather than sharp citrus.', 'Korea''s original energy tonic since 1963, built on taurine, ginseng and royal jelly rather than sharp citrus.', 'Bacchus has been on Korean shelves since 1963 and is still the drink people reach for at the end of a long shift, sold everywhere from pharmacies to convenience stores. The 250ml can carries 2,000mg of taurine and 80mg of caffeine alongside Korean ginseng extract and royal jelly, which gives it a rounder, faintly herbal sweetness instead of the sharp citrus most energy drinks lead with. Lightly carbonated and easier to finish than its size suggests.', 'Drink well chilled. One can is a serving — it carries about as much caffeine as a strong cup of coffee.', 'Korean ginseng extract, royal jelly, high fructose corn syrup, caffeine, taurine, inositol, sugar, nicotinamide, pyridoxine, riboflavin, thiamine nitrate, citric acid anhydrous, sucralose, L-lysine, sodium benzoate, sodium chloride, apple juice, essences (orange, pineapple, strawberry), artificial flavours and purified water.', 'Contains royal jelly. Contains caffeine (80mg per can) — not recommended for children or pregnant women.', '{"basis": "Per 250ml can", "energy": "120 kcal", "fat": "0g", "satFat": "0g", "carbs": "30g", "fibre": null, "sugars": "30g", "protein": "0g", "sodium": "60mg"}'::jsonb, 'https://kfoods.lk/images/products/dong-a-bacchus-energy-drink.jpeg', 'assets/products/bacchus.jpeg', 'https://kfoods.lk/products/bacchus.html', 88, true),
